  "title": "Cranberry-Orange Spiced Oatmeal",
  "description": "Start your day with a wholesome breakfast of old-fashioned oatmeal seasoned with cinnamon, blueberries, and dried cranberries, sweetened with orange juice, and cooked in minutes in the microwave. Add optional ginger and turmeric for a flavorful twist.",
